that's kind of how that's how land planning worked 100 years ago And um we're kind of going back to that And so I I show these images just to show you what we're trying to do is nothing uh new or or unusual The upper left shows an old historic neighborhood Upper right is actually a project right here in Cheyenne And those are roughly 28 foot wide lots Uh lower left is a project I did in Longmont on 24 foot wide lots and lower right is a product that we built both in Loveland and at the Stapleton redevelopment in Denver and those are also on 24 foot wide lots U there was other discussion about the green belt and

